         <!--Gratiano et Probo co(n)s(ule) / ter(tium) non(as) feb(ruarias) ego Cons/tantius compari meae / Agrige ((monogramma Christi))  que vixit / ann(os) LX et mecum / fecit ann(os) XL m(enses) / VIII d(ies) VIII / XIIII --><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/>Gratiano et Probo co<expan><ex>n</ex><abbr>s</abbr><ex>ule</ex></expan><lb n="2"/><expan><abbr>ter</abbr><ex>tium</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>non</abbr><ex>as</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>feb</abbr><ex>ruarias</ex></expan> ego Cons<lb break="no" n="3"/>tantius compari meae<lb n="4"/>Agrige <g type="descriptive">monogramma Christi</g>  que vixit<lb n="5"/><expan><abbr>ann</abbr><ex>os</ex></expan> LX et mecum<lb n="6"/>fecit <expan><abbr>ann</abbr><ex>os</ex></expan> XL <expan><abbr>m</abbr><ex>enses</ex></expan><lb n="7"/>VIII <expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>ies</ex></expan> VIII<lb n="8"/>XIIII </ab></div>
         <div type="apparatus">
            <p>4.((monogramma Christi cum alpha et omega)) Grige; Diehl in ILCV ad loc. cit. vel AGRICIA pro AGROECIA;  Ferrua ad loc. cit. 8. Silvagni in ICVR ad loc. cit. "nota 'XIIII' horarum fortasse numerum indicat"</p>
